[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4800.229, "timestamp": "01:20:00", "text": "啊，说实话，其实没"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4804.149, "timestamp": "01:20:04", "text": "必要买新的。 但形势"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4808.63, "timestamp": "01:20:08", "text": "使我陷入了那种境地。 不，就像我被"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4812.47, "timestamp": "01:20:12", "text": "邀请加入某个机构之类的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4815.35, "timestamp": "01:20:15", "text": "我希望一切顺利，但结果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4818.95, "timestamp": "01:20:18", "text": "并不顺利。 呃（笑）"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4821.91, "timestamp": "01:20:21", "text": "那是唯一的原因，否则我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4824.149, "timestamp": "01:20:24", "text": "对当时拥有的任何东西都会很满意。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4827.27, "timestamp": "01:20:27", "text": "不是那种想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4830.39, "timestamp": "01:20:30", "text": "拥有伟大东西的人。 我来这里只是为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4834.709, "timestamp": "01:20:34", "text": "享受乐趣。 呃，展示一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4837.11, "timestamp": "01:20:37", "text": "很棒的东西。 其他的东西会随着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4839.43, "timestamp": "01:20:39", "text": "时间慢慢来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4841.43, "timestamp": "01:20:41", "text": "事情就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4844.149, "timestamp": "01:20:44", "text": "。  [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4845.83, "timestamp": "01:20:45", "text": "我当时就觉得，没错，肯定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4848.87, "timestamp": "01:20:48", "text": "有人为此付出了很多努力。 所以我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4851.43, "timestamp": "01:20:51", "text": "就想，这完全就是我当时觉得“"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4856.215, "timestamp": "01:20:56", "text": "好吧，我能搞定”的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4856.871, "timestamp": "01:20:56", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4857.51, "timestamp": "01:20:57", "text": "[倒吸一口凉气]"}]